    "dist/highs.wasm",
    "limits.mjs",
    "shape-budget.mjs",
    "mod/handlers.json"
  ],
  "modifications": [
    "Upstream snapshots are byte-identical. Build-time lp-observability.json adds call counters, bounded failure messages, and structural/LP budget checks; no mathematical changes.",
    "Project-owned runtime-entry.ts validates with the upstream schema but calculates the exact original JSON (not its field-stripped/rounded parse result); additionally validates integer parallel, profile.kind, positive plan seeds/pins, reserved/duplicate identifiers, and raw SolveInputJson. budget.ts caps graph structure, LP dimensions/nonzeros/dense cells, and simplex tableau cells before allocation.",
    "Node worker requires HiGHS to initialize, supplies an import.meta.url-relative WASM path, and never fetches assets.",
    "types/model.d.ts converts the two numeric constants into ambient declarations and rewrites the sole type import to ./plan-types.js; types/plan-types.d.ts is verbatim upstream."
  ],
  "build": {
    "command": "node brain/vendor/gtnh-planner/generate.mjs --tools /path/to/isolated-toolchain",
